#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:2
msgid "Login for the dashboard"
msgstr "仪表盘登录"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:4
msgid ""
"The web dashboard needs a login form -- random people on the LAN shouldn't "
"see the yard. That's what cookie-backed sessions and the login decorator do."
msgstr "网页仪表盘需要一个登录表单——局域网上的陌生人不应该看到院子里的画面。这正是基于 cookie 的会话和登录装饰器要做的事情。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:8
msgid ""
"A session is a small dict the cam writes into a cookie. The cookie is signed"
" with the JWT-signing secret loaded earlier in the chapter, so the browser "
"can carry it around but can't tamper with the contents without invalidating "
"the signature."
msgstr ""
"会话是摄像头写入 cookie 的一个小字典。该 cookie 用本章前面加载的 JWT "
"签名密钥进行签名，因此浏览器可以随身携带它，但无法在不使签名失效的情况下篡改其内容。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:14
msgid "Set up the session and login objects"
msgstr "设置会话和登录对象"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:16
msgid ""
":class:`microdot.session.Session` installs the session machinery on ``app``."
" :class:`microdot.login.Login` adds the ``login_required``-style decorator "
"and the ``login_user`` / ``logout_user`` helpers:"
msgstr ""
":class:`microdot.session.Session` 在 ``app`` 上安装会话机制。\\ "
":class:`microdot.login.Login` 添加了 ``login_required`` 风格的装饰器以及 ``login_user``"
" / ``logout_user`` 辅助函数："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:39
msgid ""
"``http_only=True`` keeps JavaScript on the page from reading the cookie -- a"
" layered defense against an XSS attacker hijacking the session. "
"``secure=False`` is a placeholder until HTTPS is in place; flip it to "
"``True`` once the server runs over TLS so the cookie never travels over "
"plain HTTP."
msgstr ""
"``http_only=True`` 让页面上的 JavaScript 无法读取 cookie——这是针对 XSS 攻击者劫持会话的一层防御。\\ "
"``secure=False`` 是 HTTPS 就绪之前的占位设置；一旦服务器通过 TLS 运行，就把它改成 ``True``\\ ，这样 "
"cookie 就永远不会以明文 HTTP 传输。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:47
msgid ""
"*Cross-site scripting* (XSS) is the class of attacks where the attacker gets"
" JavaScript executing inside the user's view of a trusted page -- typically "
"through an unescaped form field, an HTML-rendered comment, or a vulnerable "
"third-party widget. The ``http_only`` cookie flag doesn't prevent XSS; it "
"just keeps the session cookie out of reach of the injected script, so a "
"successful XSS can't trivially be turned into session hijacking."
msgstr ""
"*跨站脚本*\\ （XSS）是这样一类攻击：攻击者设法让 JavaScript 在用户看到的受信任页面中执行——通常是通过未转义的表单字段、以 HTML"
" 渲染的评论，或者一个有漏洞的第三方小部件。\\ ``http_only`` 这个 cookie 标志并不能防止 XSS；它只是让会话 cookie "
"不被注入的脚本触及，因此一次成功的 XSS 攻击无法被轻易转化为会话劫持。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:56
msgid ""
"The ``user_loader`` is called on every protected request to turn the ID "
"stored in the session into the user record the handler will see. Keep it "
"cheap -- it runs on the hot path."
msgstr ""
"``user_loader`` 会在每个受保护的请求上被调用，把存储在会话中的 ID 转换成处理函数将看到的用户记录。让它保持轻量——它运行在热路径上。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:61
msgid "Login form, login post, logout"
msgstr "登录表单、登录提交、登出"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:63
msgid ""
"The login form itself is a static page served from ``/sdcard/static/`` just "
"like the dashboard. The form ``POST``\\ s to ``/login``:"
msgstr ""
"登录表单本身是从 ``/sdcard/static/`` 提供的静态页面，就和仪表盘一样。该表单以 ``POST`` 方式提交到 "
"``/login``\\ ："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:87
msgid ""
":meth:`microdot.login.Login.login_user` writes the session cookie and "
"returns a 302 redirect to whatever page the client originally tried to reach"
" (``next=`` query argument, falling back to ``/``). ``remember=True`` also "
"writes a longer-lived ``_remember`` cookie so the session survives a browser"
" restart."
msgstr ""
":meth:`microdot.login.Login.login_user` 写入会话 cookie，并返回一个 302 "
"重定向，指向客户端最初尝试访问的页面（\\ ``next=`` 查询参数，缺省时回退到 ``/``\\ ）。\\ ``remember=True`` "
"还会写入一个存活时间更长的 ``_remember`` cookie，这样会话就能在浏览器重启后依然有效。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:93
msgid ""
":meth:`microdot.login.Login.logout_user` clears both cookies and a follow-up"
" redirect sends the browser back to the form."
msgstr ":meth:`microdot.login.Login.logout_user` 清除两个 cookie，随后的重定向把浏览器送回到表单。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:97
msgid "Protecting the dashboard"
msgstr "保护仪表盘"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:99
msgid ""
"Decorate every dashboard-facing route with ``@login`` so an unauthenticated "
"request gets a 302 to ``/login`` instead of the content:"
msgstr ""
"为每个面向仪表盘的路由都加上 ``@login`` 装饰器，这样未经认证的请求得到的就是一个跳转到 ``/login`` 的 302，而不是内容本身："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:132
msgid ""
"The token-based API endpoints (``/api/login``, ``/api/ack``) stay token-"
"based -- they're for the phone app, not the browser. Token auth and session "
"auth happily coexist on the same ``app``."
msgstr ""
"基于令牌的 API 端点（\\ ``/api/login``\\ 、\\ ``/api/ack``\\ "
"）仍然保持基于令牌的方式——它们是给手机应用用的，不是给浏览器用的。令牌认证和会话认证可以在同一个 ``app`` 上愉快地共存。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:137
msgid "Fresh vs remembered sessions"
msgstr "全新会话与记住的会话"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:139
msgid ""
"The ``_remember`` cookie keeps the user logged in across browser restarts, "
"but it's a weaker form of auth -- the browser could have been left in a "
"cafe. For routes that change passwords, register API tokens, or do anything "
"else worth re-authenticating for, decorate with :meth:`@login.fresh "
"<microdot.login.Login.fresh>` instead of ``@login``. A fresh login is one "
"where the user typed their password *this* session; a remembered login is "
"not. The dashboard has nothing that rises to that bar, but the decorator is "
"there when you need it."
msgstr ""
"``_remember`` cookie "
"让用户在浏览器重启后仍保持登录状态，但这是一种较弱的认证形式——浏览器可能被遗忘在了某家咖啡馆里。对于修改密码、注册 API "
"令牌，或做任何值得重新认证的事情的路由，请改用 :meth:`@login.fresh <microdot.login.Login.fresh>` "
"而不是 ``@login`` 来装饰。全新登录是指用户在\\ *本*\\ "
"次会话中亲手输入了密码；记住的登录则不是。仪表盘里没有任何东西达到那个门槛，但当你需要时，这个装饰器就在那里。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/sessions-login.rst:148
msgid "The dashboard now requires a login before any of its routes respond."
msgstr "现在，仪表盘的任何路由在响应之前都需要先登录。"
